WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:04,460
It's me who underestimated her. She's not bad.

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,820
I can't react in time, but

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:10,340
Does a kitchen knife count as a self-contained weapon?

4
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:12,220
Should we rule her out?

5
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:13,860
So difficult to handle

6
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,220
Is she sick?

7
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,180
And I don’t want to see my students doing well.

8
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:24,990
Hiding so many things

9
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:27,580
Sure enough, I still find her very unpleasant to look at.

10
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,300
S1 yellow fresh plus 19 points
